# plan 0044: open the party screen and declare hostility to the other player (first row). The button position is
# UNCALIBRATED: plan 0011 measured only INVITE/ACCEPT (297,141) and LEAVE (333,87); the hostile button of row 1 is
# assumed to the right of INVITE. The driver's live test (plan 0044 log) measures it and replaces this line.
